Boolean Data Type & If-Else Statements
Today i learned to use boolean with if else statements.

Concepts Covered

How to include the stdbool.h header file.
How to declare a Boolean variable using bool.
How to store true and false values.
How to use Boolean variables inside if-else statements.
How to execute different blocks of code depending on a Boolean condition.
Project: Student Status Checker

I created a simple C program that checks whether someone is a student.

If isStudent = true, it prints "You are a student".
If isStudent = false, it prints "You are NOT a student".

What I Practiced

Boolean data types
true and false values
stdbool.h header file
Conditional statements
Decision-making in C

Today's Progress: Learned how Boolean values work in C and how to use them with if-else statements.